{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"单Lie代数"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“单 Lie 代数”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathfrak g$ 为有限维 Lie 代数. 若 $\\mathfrak g$ 非 Abel, 且没有非平凡的理想, 则称之为<strong>单 Lie 代数</strong>.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单Lie群","text":"单 Lie 群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"半单Lie代数","text":"半单 Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}